  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La cafeter&iacute;a Druida de Onda ha acogido la noche de este viernes un concurrido concierto&nbsp;de Colombo que ha servido tambi&eacute;n para presentar su primer video-clip, Victoria, realizado por V&iacute;ctor Sorl&iacute; y grabado en agosto en Vstudio junto a otros dos temas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_4302.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Al final de la actuaci&oacute;n, se han unido al grupo L&oacute;pez y Chorva para interpretar conjuntamente versiones m&iacute;ticas del rock.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4198.jpg\" alt=\"img_4198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4200.jpg\" alt=\"img_4200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4201.jpg\" alt=\"img_4201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4202.jpg\" alt=\"img_4202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4205.jpg\" alt=\"img_4205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4207.jpg\" alt=\"img_4207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4209.jpg\" alt=\"img_4209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombodruida211114/img_4211.jpg\" alt=\"img_4211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colombo